al stuff like share  subscribe i have a patreon if you like  what i do and you want to support me  that is in fact  what pays my bills and how i make my  living but even if you don't  all the other things i mentioned that  they help i have links to merch besides  um and all the usual things but you also  don't have to because  at the end of the day you're the council  i just run the meetings and until next  time this council  is adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  so  [Music]  um  [Music]

